@baseUrl = http://localhost:9377
@accessToken = {{socialLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 0. 소셜 로그인
# @name socialLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "providerUserId": "google-tag-test-001",
  "email": "tag.test@example.com",
  "name": "태그테스트"
}

### 1. handle 변경 가능 여부 (tagId는 태그 생성 후)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags/1/handle/change-availability
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. handle 변경/최초 설정 (설정·변경 후 30일 쿨다운)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags/1/handle
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handle": "royal_canin_01"
}
